    <data key="d0">ThreatStack Security Telemetry Ingestion and Analytics Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=INog0_9tCtY</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for ingesting customer security telemetry (EC2 agents, CloudTrail) via Kafka into real-time (Flink to S3) and batch (EMR to Parquet S3) pipelines, orchestrated by EC2 and queried by Athena, SageMaker, and EMR.</data>
    <data key="d3">Security, Big Data &amp; Analytics</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
